,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.252898694,"data":"# Prospective transfer-normalization study — 10 November 2026\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.25294819,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.252953379,"data":"Primary aim: official pooled LOSO cell BA on completely held-out people.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.252957196,"data":"Also report equal-person LOSO and per-person deltas; later_last is separate.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.252960687,"data":"Historical complete baseline:63.229380% OOF,71.639456% later_last.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.252964279,"data":"No baseline fitting, historical parity gates or remote preflight tests.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.252967814,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.252971031,"data":"Literature was reviewed before writing the new model: literature/REVIEW_RU.md.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.252974613,"data":"These are new causal adaptations, not claims to reproduce contest scores.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.252978466,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.252981811,"data":"## Fourteen fixed model configurations\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.25298511,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.252988215,"data":"| ID | Change | Hypothesis |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.252991631,"data":"|---|---|---|\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.252994876,"data":"| filter_p10 |16 filter moments pooled over62 temporal positions | Less noisy target statistics |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.252998856,"data":"| filter_p40 | Same, source prior40 | Stronger shrinkage for new people |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253014864,"data":"| filter_person_prior | Equal-person source mean/second moment | Avoid domination by multi-session people |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253018805,"data":"| filter_half |50% residual mixture with unnormalized hidden state | Preserve discriminative power |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253022506,"data":"| filter_clip | Limit std gain to[.5,2] | Restrict erroneous amplification |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253026064,"data":"| filter_ttn16 |16 sigmoid interpolation coefficients, source-trained,L2.01 | Learn a small amount of adaptation |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253029769,"data":"| early_and_filter | Align pre-square activations and pooled log-power | Correct shift before nonlinearities |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253033568,"data":"| multiscale12_filter | Three4-filter branches,kernels13/25/51 | Complementary temporal scales at small capacity |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253037826,"data":"| point_p40 | Existing992-coordinate policy,prior40 | Isolate prior strength |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253041473,"data":"| point_half | Existing point policy,50% residual | Isolate adaptation strength |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253045057,"data":"| point_person_prior | Point policy,equal-person source moments | Isolate source weighting |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253048623,"data":"| filter_memory50 | Exponential moment decay.98 | Adapt within-session changes |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.25305242,"data":"| filter_shift12 | Filter alignment +up to100ms reflection-padded shifts | Combine two supported mechanisms |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253056392,"data":"| filter_ls005 | Filter alignment +label smoothing.05 | Limit overconfidence |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253060093,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.25306335,"data":"Unchanged:41channels,480samples,causal input EA on1–58Hz with prior5;\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253069023,"data":"Shallow16 except the explicitly named12-filter multiscale variant;\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253072616,"data":"dropout.5,AdamW.001,decay.01,cosine Tmax100,max30epochs,patience6;\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253076215,"data":"class-weighted CE,inner people-held-out cellNLL and SWAD ratio.1.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253079862,"data":"Source-only BN recalibration/frozen BN during prefix passes follows the\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.25308359,"data":"previous positive experiment. Candidate model construction preserves RNG state.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.25308734,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253090726,"data":"Per-filter mean and second moment are first computed within each fully\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.25309485,"data":"available window, then accumulated across current/past windows. Pooling time\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253098526,"data":"for statistics does not remove the62 temporal features used by the head.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253109718,"data":"Mixed variance includes the between-mean term. Target labels never update\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253113562,"data":"statistics. The16 learned coefficients are frozen at inference.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253117422,"data":"Equal-person policy changes source hidden moments only; it does not pretend\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253121193,"data":"to change every source weighting or the loss to a person-balanced objective.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253125044,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253133597,"data":"All10LOSO +later_last,2seeds:308 outer fits; each has inner selection/refit.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253137082,"data":"For every family both seeds are required for its primary mean2 result.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253140784,"data":"No seed is selected based on outer scores. Outer participant data never enter\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253144259,"data":"the feature extractor,source prior,learned alpha or inner epoch selection.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253147926,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253151234,"data":"## Fixed fusion hypotheses\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.25315468,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253158034,"data":"1. Each new two-seed expert alone.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253161636,"data":"2. Add.1/.2/.3 to the current63.2294% full baseline,using the expert's causal\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253165108,"data":"   balance1 probabilities. These are fixed before the run.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253168722,"data":"3. Replace the previously added normalized CNN branch: .8*old62.7234% baseline\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253172031,"data":"   +.2*new normalized expert. This is the most matched architecture comparison.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253175457,"data":"4. Two bounded,label-free gates: seed JS agreement and seed agreement with\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253179129,"data":"   prefix-size shrinkage. Weight stays within[.1,.3]. Agreement is a heuristic,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253182628,"data":"   not a guarantee of correctness. No fitted stacking on reused outer OOF.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253201955,"data":"5. Previous fixed70%Lag4+30%newCNN(T4),with balance and the unchanged\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253211048,"data":"   soft50/half-strength causal transducer,reported as distinct complete models.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253215033,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253218626,"data":"Current/future-window distinction is enforced by cumulative computations;\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253222371,"data":"batch evaluation is only a vectorization of the causal prefix equations.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253226871,"data":"Session state resets independently. Subject/session/interface/run metadata\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.25323076,"data":"are used only for data splits,resets and scoring; model input is EEG alone.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.25323398,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.25323714,"data":"## Output and execution\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253240384,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.25324352,"data":"One private Kaggle T4 notebook,two GPU workers. Application cap600min;\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253247184,"data":"Kaggle timeout41400s leaves room for summaries/packaging. Stops as soon as\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253251021,"data":"all jobs finish; the cap is not an estimate of expected runtime.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253254461,"data":"No local or remote background poller after launch. No competition submission.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253258388,"data":"Completed predictions and failures saved atomically per job. Reports require\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253261894,"data":"all10LOSO folds and show incomplete jobs explicitly. Source/checkpoint/curves\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253265494,"data":"and held-out logits/hidden states are retained.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253273868,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253277307,"data":"The public CV has been reused repeatedly. Best post-hoc score is exploratory;\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253280633,"data":"these data do not establish a hidden-cohort gain or significance. Comparisons\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253284048,"data":"with different people/metrics in the review are never pooled with PROTEUS BA.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.253287307,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":27.254078157,"data":"No baseline refits, reproduction gates or preliminary test stage.\n"}
